<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S7.SS2.SSS5" title="In 7.2 Dataset Statistics ‣ 7 More Details about W³DA Dataset ‣ Where, What, Why: Towards Explainable Driver Attention Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.2.5 </span>High-frequency Cognitive Causes (<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Why</span>)</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS3" title="In 7 More Details about W³DA Dataset ‣ Where, What, Why: Towards Explainable Driver Attention Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.3 </span>More Details on Data Annotation</span></a>
